      "8.2 DISCOM charges and security deposit. The DISCOM security deposit, demand note charges, service line and development charges, transformer and power-infrastructure charges and all other one-time charges levied by the DISCOM shall be borne and funded by the Franchisee, and are included within the consideration set out in Schedule II. The quantum of such charges is determined solely by the DISCOM and cannot be ascertained at the date of this Agreement; accordingly, where the amount actually levied exceeds the provision made in Schedule II, Livanto shall invoice the excess to the Franchisee with supporting DISCOM documentation and the Franchisee shall pay the same within fifteen (15) days, and where it is less, the difference shall be refunded to or adjusted in favour of the Franchisee. The security deposit shall be held in Livanto's name for the account of the Franchisee; on closure of the connection or termination of this Agreement, Livanto shall pursue its refund and shall remit the amount actually recovered to the Franchisee, net of any statutory deduction and of any sum then due from the Franchisee to Livanto.",
      "8.3 Livanto shall obtain and maintain all approvals, permits, licences, no-objection certificates and statutory compliances required for the installation and operation of the Charging Station, including electrical inspectorate approval, fire and local body clearances. The statutory fees and charges payable to any authority shall be borne by the Franchisee as part of Schedule II; Livanto shall bear the cost of its own effort in obtaining them and shall keep the Franchisee indemnified against any penalty arising from Livanto's failure to obtain or maintain the same.",
      "8.4 During any Revenue Share Period the Electricity Cost shall be a pass-through in the settlement waterfall under Clause 9.4 and shall be borne out of Gross Revenue at actuals, without mark-up. During any Fixed Payment Period the Electricity Cost shall be borne by Livanto out of the Gross Revenue retained by it. Livanto shall furnish copies of DISCOM invoices on request.",
